    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 5.833,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "in which state they had been given shelter by the Mahommedan rulers. This event, added to the occurrence of other raids from across the border, led to an irregular expedition being led into Trengganu"
  }, {
