    "bounding box" : [ 20.6, 99.397, 205.55, 105.817 ],
    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 6.417,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "and Trengganu; on the S. by the Negri Sembilan and Johor; on"
  }, {
