    "bounding box" : [ 20.6, 84.797, 205.589, 98.806 ],
    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 6.806,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "the E, by the China Sea; and on the W. by the protected states of Perak and Selangor. The coast-line is about 112 m. in length;"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 98,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 214.6, 86.197, 397.967, 98.143 ],
    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 5.833,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The census taken in April 1901 gave the total population of Pahang at 84,113, of whom 73,462 were Malays, 8695 Chinese, 1227 Tamils"
  }, {
