    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 5.639,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "and other natives of India, 180 Europeans and Eurasians, and 549 people of other nationalities. The population"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
